# #1099 Stage 3 groundwork: what NVDA says for each kind of rich content in the hosted editor.
# The spike is started with --rich. Nothing is expected here; the log is the result.
w 4
q {TAB}
w 2
q +{TAB}
w 3
k %y
w 4
k ^{HOME}
w 4
# Down through every line: heading, paragraph, bullets, numbers, quote, picture, table rows.
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {DOWN}
w 4
# The link, by word.
k ^{HOME}
w 3
k {DOWN}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
k ^{RIGHT}
w 3
# Formatting where the caret is: on the link, then on the heading.
n f
w 5
k ^{HOME}
w 3
n f
w 5
# The picture, by character.
k ^{HOME}
w 2
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
k {DOWN}
w 4
k {END}
w 3
